WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:04.320
Cora was in her den.

2
00:00:04.321 --> 00:00:07.034
Suddenly Mo swam in.

3
00:00:07.035 --> 00:00:09.821
He was covered with dirt.

4
00:00:09.822 --> 00:00:18.316
"Ugh!" Cora said. "What happened?"

5
00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:21.754
"The water is dirty today," Mo said.

6
00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:26.336
"It's hard to see."

7
00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:33.123
"Hmm," Cora said. "Let's check it out."

8
00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:39.775
Cora and Mo swam through the dirty water.

9
00:00:39.776 --> 00:00:46.531
Fish were swimming away from the reef.

10
00:00:46.532 --> 00:00:50.829
Cora swam up toward the surface.

11
00:00:50.830 --> 00:01:00.454
She saw large, noisy boats.

12
00:01:00.455 --> 00:01:04.069
"There are boats on the surface," Cora said.

13
00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:06.907
"They're making the mess!" Mo said.

14
00:01:06.908 --> 00:01:09.956
"And the noise," Cora said.

15
00:01:09.957 --> 00:01:13.210
Just then they heard a new sound.

16
00:01:13.211 --> 00:01:18.394
"Someone is crying!" Cora said.

17
00:01:18.395 --> 00:01:25.346
They swam toward the sound.

18
00:01:25.347 --> 00:01:30.230
"It's a humpback whale!" Mo said.

19
00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:33.442
"What's wrong?" Cora asked the whale.

20
00:01:33.443 --> 00:01:39.761
The whale sniffled. "The whales are moving.

21
00:01:39.762 --> 00:01:43.471
We're swimming to our feeding spot.

22
00:01:43.472 --> 00:01:47.402
But I lost my mama!"

23
00:01:47.403 --> 00:01:50.363
"Oh no!" Mo said.

24
00:01:50.364 --> 00:01:53.774
"What's your name?" Cora asked.

25
00:01:53.775 --> 00:01:58.519
"Wanda." The whale sniffled.

26
00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.933
"I can help you," Cora said.

27
00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:05.408
"You can?" Wanda said.

28
00:02:05.409 --> 00:02:07.984
"Yes!" Cora said.

29
00:02:07.985 --> 00:02:10.492
"I have a special compass.

30
00:02:10.493 --> 00:02:15.271
It will help us find your mama!"

